sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Caller as Synthetic test caller
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant R as Registries
  participant P as Policy / Redactor
  participant C as ModelClient (fake / explicit mock)
  participant A as AuditSink (in-memory)
  Caller->>O: run(role, template, variables, documents, matter, actor)
  Note over Caller,O: Required identity identifiers checked before registry resolution
  O->>R: Resolve role and template, verify match
  alt Invalid role, missing identity or template mismatch
    O-->>Caller: Raise before model call, no completion event
  else Valid setup
    O->>P: Select policy, redact variables, titles, text
    P-->>O: Safe inputs + shared in-memory mapping
    O->>R: Render template instructions
    Note over O,C: Hash canonical request, documents remain separate untrusted blocks
    O->>C: await complete(request)
    alt Success
      C-->>O: ModelResponse
      O->>A: await emit(success metadata + hashes)
      alt Sink accepts
        A-->>O: Recorded in local list
        O->>P: Re-identify output
        O-->>Caller: OrchestratorResult
      else Sink fails
        A-->>O: Error
        O-->>Caller: AuditEmissionError, no result returned
      end
    else Exception caught by run
      C-->>O: Exception
      O->>A: await emit(error metadata)
      O-->>Caller: Re-raise, sink failure becomes AuditEmissionError
    end
  end
  Note over O,A: Completion-only audit: cancellation / process crash can leave no durable event
